# --- Local-only workspace for confidential material -------------------------------------------------------------
# This repository is PUBLIC. Anything committed here is world-readable and stays in git history, in forks and in
# third-party clones after deletion — there is no undo. Project documentation that must not be published (customer
# specifications, hospital records, architecture with real endpoints, anything carrying personal or patient data)
# belongs under local/ and is never staged. scripts/verify-no-confidential.sh fails the build if it ever is.
local/
private/
**/local-docs/
*.confidential.*
